<a id="binary_search"></a>
## `binary_search`

```sisu
def binary_search[T: Ord](items: Slice[T], target: T) -> int?
    requires items.is_sorted()
    ensures match result:
        case Some(i): items[i] == target
        case None: not items.contains(target)
```

<a id="Account"></a>
## `Account`

```sisu
struct Account
    balance: Money
    limit: Money
    invariant self.balance >= -self.limit
```

<a id="Account.withdraw"></a>
### `Account.withdraw`

```sisu
def withdraw(mut self, amount: Money)
    requires amount > Money.ZERO
    ensures self.balance == old(self.balance) - amount
    # re-checks the invariant of `Account` on return
```

<a id="Account.try_withdraw"></a>
### `Account.try_withdraw`

```sisu
def try_withdraw(mut self, amount: Money) -> ! Overdrawn
    # re-checks the invariant of `Account` on return
```

