<a id="Port"></a>
## `Port`

```sisu
type Port = int where 1 <= self <= 65535
    def try_from(value: int) -> Port ! RefinementError
```

<a id="Percent"></a>
## `Percent`

```sisu
type Percent = int where 0 <= self <= 100
    def try_from(value: int) -> Percent ! RefinementError
```

<a id="NonEmpty"></a>
## `NonEmpty`

```sisu
type NonEmpty[T] = list[T] where not self.is_empty()
    def try_from(value: list[T]) -> NonEmpty[T] ! RefinementError

impl[T: Copy] NonEmpty[T]
```

